<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><B>About Ribbon</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">Ribbon Communications (Nasdaq: RBBN) is a global provider of voice
communications software,&nbsp;IP routing, and optical networking to mobile and wireline service providers, enterprises, critical infrastructure
and defense sectors. We support our customers&rsquo; Path to Autonomous Networks by leveraging the latest AIOps automation platforms and
Agentic AI technologies, helping them deliver better customer experiences, reduce operational costs, and achieve sustainable growth.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">To learn more about Ribbon, visit <U>rbbn.com</U>.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

